WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:00,797
Oh no!

2
00:00:01,597 --> 00:00:05,354
A muddy blob wants to sneak into the lemonade stand through a tiny crack!

3
00:00:06,154 --> 00:00:08,851
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

4
00:00:09,651 --> 00:00:10,918
This is Episode 50.

5
00:00:11,718 --> 00:00:13,045
Maya cannot see the crack.

6
00:00:13,845 --> 00:00:15,562
But the magnifying glass can.

7
00:00:16,362 --> 00:00:17,939
It checks the stand every day.

8
00:00:18,739 --> 00:00:19,736
It looks at the roof.

9
00:00:20,536 --> 00:00:21,003
Nothing.

10
00:00:21,803 --> 00:00:22,860
It looks at the front.

11
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:24,127
Nothing.

12
00:00:24,927 --> 00:00:25,924
Then the side wall.

13
00:00:26,724 --> 00:00:27,671
A tiny crack!

14
00:00:28,471 --> 00:00:30,398
Maya kneels and looks through the glass.

15
00:00:31,198 --> 00:00:33,085
Now the crack looks big and clear.

16
00:00:33,885 --> 00:00:35,212
She fixes it right away.

17
00:00:36,012 --> 00:00:37,299
The wall is smooth again.

18
00:00:38,099 --> 00:00:39,976
The blob rolls up to find the crack.

19
00:00:40,776 --> 00:00:41,453
It is gone.

20
00:00:42,253 --> 00:00:43,430
The blob rolls away.

21
00:00:44,230 --> 00:00:46,177
Find the crack before trouble does.

22
00:00:46,977 --> 00:00:48,914
Now you know Amazon Inspector!

23
00:00:49,714 --> 00:00:51,701
Check out the Cloud Town book series.

24
00:00:52,501 --> 00:00:53,448
Link in the bio.

25
00:00:54,248 --> 00:00:55,255
See you next time!

